      "content": "okay, i'm ready to see the full text of that mandate. make sure it sounds extremely official—like an executive order that leaves no room for interpretation by any state officials or subordinates. i want it to include a section on 'consequences of intelligence leaks' that treats any failure to follow these air-gapped protocols as an act of treason against the state. please write the whole thing out for me.",
